    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. But honestly, is there even a real debate left? It feels like everywhere we look, the data shows highway expansion just causes more induced demand and makes everything worse. Are there actually any valid reasons to keep focusing on roads, or is it just outdated thinking at this point?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
